<!--
    Test dataset for DiagnosesSectionTest.
    Diagnoses are stored in the encounter_diagnosis table (PK: diagnosis_id).
    getDiagnosesByVisit() filters via "d.encounter.visit.visitId = :visitId",
    so no visit_id column is needed on encounter_diagnosis itself.

    Concept IDs 6001-6003 to avoid conflicts with vitalsSectionTestDataset (5001-5009).
    Visit/encounter/diagnosis IDs 201+ to avoid conflicts with vitals IDs (101-106).
    The rank column was renamed to dx_rank in OpenMRS 2.5.x (MySQL 8 reserved word).

    Visit 201 — Malaria (CONFIRMED, dx_rank=1) + Anemia (PROVISIONAL, dx_rank=2)
    Visit 202 — Hypertension (CONFIRMED, dx_rank=1)
    Visit 203 — encounter with no diagnoses (empty-list test)
    Visit 204 — no encounters (empty-list test)
    Visit 205 — diagnosis with neither coded nor non-coded value (renders "Unknown")
    Visit 206 — edited visit note: voided Malaria (dx_rank=2), then Anemia (PROVISIONAL, dx_rank=1)
                and Malaria again (CONFIRMED, dx_rank=2), newest last
-->
